From 9a76b18d2983f0637dcf75b50bb77976ad29e5ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:03:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Updater on Linux and macOS: curl download, a shell script
 unpacks while the game runs

The same flow as Windows: the release's .tar.gz (the name holds linux or macos) is fetched with curl, a detached sh script unpacks it into a staging folder reporting progress through a file, and once the game has closed it copies the files over the game's folder (not game/ or data/, except data/fonts and new textures; textures.ini is replaced) and starts the game again through run.sh.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
